/T (This study is a structured secondary-evidence assessment combining quantitative description, documentary policy review, public-finance tracing and comparative institutional analysis. Its core sources are the national NALABE 2022 assessment, NBS/UNICEF MICS 2021, the federal 2024/25 school census, Bauchi SUBEB public data, UBEC correspondence and matching-grant records provided to SDCI, Bauchi budget-performance reports, programme documents and published external evaluations. It is not a contemporary school census, a field audit or a causal evaluation of state programmes.)
/E (This study is a structured secondary-evidence assessment combining quantitative description, documentary policy review, public-finance tracing and comparative institutional analysis. Its core sources are the national NALABE 2022 assessment, NBS/UNICEF MICS 2021, the federal 2024/25 school census, Bauchi SUBEB public data, UBEC correspondence and matching-grant records provided to SDCI, Bauchi budget-performance reports, programme documents and published external evaluations. It is not a contemporary school census, a field audit or a causal evaluation of state programmes.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
