/T (Bauchi's 2022 results require grade-specific interpretation. Primary 3 English has a substantially wider gap against the national proficiency share than some other subjects, while Junior Secondary 2 mathematics is a relative exception in the cross-state table. The report must not average ten different assessments into a synthetic 'learning score' without strong methodological justification: content domains, difficulty, target populations and levels differ. [E04])
