/T (Kenya's Tusome programme combined evidence-based reading materials, teacher guides, coaching and routines for school-level implementation. Published programme analyses reported substantial improvements in earlygrade reading measures in national baseline-to-follow-up comparisons. The nationwide evaluation did not have a conventional untreated counterfactual, so attributing all observed changes exclusively to the intervention would overstate the design. [E15])
/E (Kenya's Tusome programme combined evidence-based reading materials, teacher guides, coaching and routines for school-level implementation. Published programme analyses reported substantial improvements in earlygrade reading measures in national baseline-to-follow-up comparisons. The nationwide evaluation did not have a conventional untreated counterfactual, so attributing all observed changes exclusively to the intervention would overstate the design. [E15])
/Pg 63 0 R
