/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 719 0 R
/T (Reform priorities must be differentiated by maturity. Source reconciliation, policy review, learning-assessment design and specific data requests are already ready for technical engagement. A teacher redistribution programme, expanded cash-transfer design or new digital-learning procurement is not justified solely by the present documentary findings. These interventions require verified baselines, legal and operational mandates, practical costing and explicit safeguards. A pilot may be warranted where an intervention addresses an independently confirmed gap but local effectiveness is uncertain.)
/E (Reform priorities must be differentiated by maturity. Source reconciliation, policy review, learning-assessment design and specific data requests are already ready for technical engagement. A teacher redistribution programme, expanded cash-transfer design or new digital-learning procurement is not justified solely by the present documentary findings. These interventions require verified baselines, legal and operational mandates, practical costing and explicit safeguards. A pilot may be warranted where an intervention addresses an independently confirmed gap but local effectiveness is uncertain.)
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [2]
