/T (The first operational evidence sprint should consolidate relevant documentary records, not launch a large field survey immediately. Acquire signed 2024/25 and newer Annual School Census extracts, teacher mapping, biometric verification, school facility assessments, the 2025 Basic Education Annual Work Plan, UBEC grant utilisation, education spending code breakdowns, NALABE state technical tables, AGILE cohort extracts and the relevant gender policy texts. Establish school ID crosswalks and versions. Only after that should the research team determine where field validation adds sufficient value.)
/E (The first operational evidence sprint should consolidate relevant documentary records, not launch a large field survey immediately. Acquire signed 2024/25 and newer Annual School Census extracts, teacher mapping, biometric verification, school facility assessments, the 2025 Basic Education Annual Work Plan, UBEC grant utilisation, education spending code breakdowns, NALABE state technical tables, AGILE cohort extracts and the relevant gender policy texts. Establish school ID crosswalks and versions. Only after that should the research team determine where field validation adds sufficient value.)
