/Title (The central analytical lens is an education-delivery chain: participation, regular attendance, adequate teaching conditions, effective instruction, measured learning, educational progression and sustained institutional performance. The report examines how constraints and accountability failures at any stage may prevent increased investment or enrolment from producing better educational outcomes.)
