/Title (Administrative evidence introduces a different kind of concern. The federal 2024/25 portal reported approximately 1.93 million learners in Bauchi and a statewide learner-to-teacher ratio of 47.4, while selected LGA ratios were substantially higher. Such differences justify prioritised verification of school staffing, especially where the reported ratios are extreme. They do not independently establish that the reported teachers are absent, unqualified or incorrectly deployed; those questions require matching the school census to personnel, posting and visit records. The federal and SUBEB portals also use values and denominators that have not yet been fully reconciled. [E01, E02])
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4536 0 R
>>
endobj
