/Title (Time is a necessary dimension of validity. NALABE was administered in October 2022 but published as a 2025 report; MICS household fieldwork is from 2021; the federal school census refers to 2024/25; published budget execution is for fiscal year 2025; relevant programme documents and policy statements continue into 2026. This report therefore avoids putting those data points on one apparent trend line. Trends can only be asserted where the same indicator, compatible instrument, population and denominator have been measured at multiple time points. [E25, E04, E01, E03])
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4576 0 R
/Prev 4590 0 R
