/Title (The federal 2024/25 administrative portal records 322,383 learners for Bauchi, with 28.7 learners per recorded teacher, 81.0 per reported classroom and 133.3 per recorded toilet; female teachers account for 54.2% of reported teaching staff. These are administrative aggregates rather than audited measures of daily teacher presence, functional room capacity or safe access to sanitation. The published special-needs count \(2,318\) also requires documentation of the underlying definition, referral status and duplication rules. [E01] The relatively low aggregate learner-to-teacher ratio must not be read as proof of adequate instructional availability: qualification, subjects, school clustering and attendance could still be uneven. The sanitation ratio must still be interpreted alongside functional water, cleanliness, privacy and maintenance. The higher female-teacher share is a relevant staff-composition observation, but does not establish equitable subject or grade allocation. Interpretive limitation and source requirements: school and teacher master lists with common IDs; public/private/IQS coverage by level; school geolocations; operational classrooms and WASH facilities; anonymised teacher qualification and presence verification; and a signed record of denominator reconciliation. Any LGA prioritisation should be reconsidered after those records are obtained.)
/Dest [89 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4716 0 R
>>
endobj
4723 0 obj
<<
/Title (The denominator problem is more serious than it first appears. Federal portal counts for Bauchi record 1,932,456 learners and 21,227 classrooms, which yield approximately 91 learners per classroom if simply divided. The same portal displays a learner-to-classroom ratio of 66.6. Different school levels, definitions, ownership filters or room types may explain the mismatch; no alternative ratio should be substituted until the calculation rule and data extract are obtained. The fact that a simple arithmetic cross-check does not match is a legitimate request for metadata, not evidence that the underlying system is fraudulent. [E01])
/Dest [36 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4715 0 R
/Prev 4718 0 R
/Next 4728 0 R
>>
endobj
4724 0 obj
<<
