/Title (The ultimate public-value test is straightforward: children should attend safe and functioning learning environments, receive effective instruction, demonstrate progress in literacy and numeracy, complete the relevant cycles and move to higher levels of education or productive training. Public policy should be assessed by how consistently institutions deliver those outcomes across Bauchi State.)
/Dest [86 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4743 0 R
/Prev 4769 0 R
/Next 4752 0 R
>>
endobj
4761 0 obj
