/Title (Education financing has several dimensions that are frequently conflated: appropriation, revised allocation, government release, cash disbursement, project payment, accounting expenditure, certified physical output, asset functionality and learning effect. A transparent fiscal analysis should specify which stage each source establishes. More money may be necessary in particular schools, but programme effectiveness cannot be inferred simply from a large disbursement or a high budget-execution percentage. Conversely, a zero line in one programme code does not prove that no related service was financed through another line. [E05, E06])
/Dest [44 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4826 0 R
/Next 4843 0 R
>>
endobj
