/Title (The transferable principle is the combination of practical teaching support and implementation discipline. Books that arrive without teacher guides and lesson use may have limited effect; training without coaching may decay; coaching without assessment data may be unfocused. A programme assessment in Bauchi should therefore review teaching-material quality and availability, observed lesson delivery, mentor caseload, travel feasibility and how often instructional problems are discussed and resolved.)
/Dest [63 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5026 0 R
/Prev 5035 0 R
/Next 5046 0 R
>>
endobj
5046 0 obj
<<
/Title (What is less directly transferable is national coverage scale. Kenya's programme operated within its own language, curriculum and management environment. Bauchi would need to accommodate local language needs, integration with the Nigerian curriculum, teacher deployment variation, non-formal learning pathways and potential parallel programmes. A viable approach would be to compare existing state initiatives against the Tusome package's operational requirements before commissioning a new supplier or curricular model.)
/Dest [63 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5026 0 R
/Prev 5045 0 R
/Next 5036 0 R
>>
endobj
5047 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [64 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5013 0 R
/Prev 5037 0 R
/Next 5038 0 R
>>
endobj
5048 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [59 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5041 0 R
/Next 5055 0 R
>>
endobj
5049 0 obj
<<
/Title (India offers both encouraging and cautionary examples. An experimental evaluation of monitored teacher attendance in a narrow non-formal school setting reported lower absence and higher test scores. The mechanism shows that verified implementation matters, but its camera-based incentive model cannot simply be imposed on civil-service schools without legal, labour, privacy and feasibility analysis. Separate experiments found that providing local committees with information about school oversight did not automatically improve teacher effort or pupil learning. For Bauchi, this means committees need authority, usable feedback and an actual issue-resolution route; information leaflets alone are insufficient. [E14, E15, E16, E17, E18])
/Dest [59 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5041 0 R
/Prev 5056 0 R
>>
endobj
5050 0 obj
