5054 0 obj
<<
/Title (This is highly relevant to Bauchi because learners already enrolled may not consistently acquire gradeappropriate skills. The mechanism that can transfer is diagnostic grouping, structured remedial instruction and simple progress measurement. The numerical effect should not be copied into a Bauchi forecast: the language, school timetable, teacher preparation, pupil absence, baseline competency and programme intensity could differ substantially. A more useful design question is whether targeted instruction would reach the learners who are furthest behind without excluding them from the rest of their curriculum.)
/Dest [63 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5034 0 R
/Prev 5043 0 R
/Next 5044 0 R
>>
endobj
5055 0 obj
